                                "sense_id": "0e5f1bb8-7b34-3285-a263-571dec2bf868",
                                "text": "Er liegt nicht so bequem in Bezug auf die Einfahrt zur Stadt, aber eben so bequem für den Anschluß an den Rhein und die Weiterführung der Bahn rheinaufwärts.",
                                "translation": "It is not as conveniently located for entry to the town, but it is just as convenient for connections to the Rhine and the continuation of the line upstream.",
                                "english": "It is not as conveniently located for entry to the town, but it is just as convenient for connections to the Rhine and the continuation of the line upstream."
                            },
                            {
