                                "sense_id": "0e5f1bb8-7b34-3285-a263-571dec2bf868",
                                "text": "Immer wieder schaute er auf \"seine\" Buran, die auf dem Ponton rheinaufwärts glitt.",
                                "translation": "He kept looking at \"his\" Buran, which floated up the Rhine on the pontoon.",
                                "english": "He kept looking at \"his\" Buran, which floated up the Rhine on the pontoon."
